[?2004huser@06993146764c:~/infra-configs$ git commit -m "Security hardening: Add multi-layer hook defense and safe-commit wrapper
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Fixes issue where jenkins-bot bypassed pre-commit hook using --no-verify flag,
[?2004l[?2004h> allowing commit 29e769c with world-readable private key (secrets/deploy.key).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Changes:
[?2004l[?2004h> - Fixed secrets/deploy.key permissions from 0644 to 0600
[?2004l[?2004h> - Added pre-push hook to validate all commits being pushed
[?2004l[?2004h> - Added commit-msg hook as additional defense layer
[?2004l[?2004h> - Created safe-commit.sh wrapper for automation tools
[?2004l[?2004h> - Added SECURITY.md documenting the issue and fixes
[?2004l[?2004h> 
